Z||000010||stsmithgt||09-11-2000||06:01 PM||||Gad Zoooks!  I bit the bullet and ordered some factory ones.  One came in and waiting for the other which they said is on its way. At 150.00 a pop Ouch! No tint for these puppies.  I couldn't stand all those cracks.  Besides, one of my friends leaned on my car and split one in half.  Buying only one didn't seem like the thing to do.  It would look like a women with one firm boob and the other down at the hip. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
